5. **Independent validity checks:** Fact multiset hash identical across arms; oracle VoI recomputed independently of presenter; renderer emits only validated fact IDs; deterministic replay from seed → bit-identical summary.
6. **Tests / acceptance:** Unit: partition math, hash invariance, Bayesian update. Property: null gap == 0 ± ε machine; bounded gap CI excludes 0 at b=1; ABL residual reported not forced to 0; replay deterministic. Stop if null fails.
